        "cooked": "<p>With Spite it all depends on how early you can get out omni-cannon and Ammo Drop. After spite flips, ammo drop is useless.</p>\n<p>Also, I just played the Matriarch again yesterday and I found a good team. Wraith is pretty much a must; Smoke bombs makes her counter-attacks, most fowl, and carrion fields completely impotent. She can also use infrared eyepiece to push the cohorts and Horrid Cacophonies to the bottom, and deal out lots of damage. Also, throat jab and stun bolt are helpful.</p>\n<p>Bunker is good if you can get Ammo drop out early. Legacy is great to have with Lead from the Front and his buffs. Then you should have Ra or Fanatic to deal lots of damage.</p>",
